dressbook><name>KURANO YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUMI CHIYOKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA MASAZUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA JUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKETANI, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JURI, TATSURO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURANO, YUKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUMI, CHIYOKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, MASAZUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, JUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A connection-confirmable information processing system comprising a system service (5) for outputting a first transmission request for outputting information about connection and processing response information of first format corresponding to the first transmission request, a WDM driver (7) for outputting a second transmission request for outputting information about connection and receiving response information of second format outputted from a WDM-adaptable device (8) for outputting response information of the second format in response to the second transmission request without responding to the first transmission request, and an FSD (13) for converting response information of the second format receivedby the the WDM driver (7) to response information of the first format which the system service (5) can handle.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Ce système de traitement de données à connexion confirmable, qui comporte un service système (5) produisant une première demande de transmission aux fins d'une sortie d'information relative à une connexion et traitant l'information de réponse d'un premier format correspondant à la première demande de transmission, comporte également un pilote de WDM (7) produisant une seconde demande de transmission aux fins d'une sortie d'information relative à une connexion et recevant une information de réponse d'un second format issue d'un dispositif compatible WDM (8) pour sortir une information de réponse du second format en réaction à la seconde demande de transmission et ce, sans avoir à répondre à la première demande de transmission. Ce système comporte également un FSD (13) destiné à convertir l'information de réponse du second format reçue par le pilote de WDM (7) en information de réponse du premier format, format accepté par le service système (5). -</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>